<Base
  title="Contact Calquna"
  description="How to reach Calquna: report a wrong answer, ask for a calculator, or flag a translation that reads badly."
>
  <h1>Contact</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    The most useful message this site gets is “this answer is wrong, here is why.” Those get
    fixed first.
  </p>
  <p>
    Write to <a href="mailto:ahmadameen222@gmail.com">ahmadameen222@gmail.com</a> with the page
    address and, if it is about a wrong answer, the numbers you put in and the answer you
    expected. Screenshots help.
  </p>
  <p>
    Requests for new calculators are welcome too. Say what you needed to work out and could
    not find a decent tool for. New tools are picked from those requests, in the order they
    are asked for, not by what is fashionable.
  </p>
  <p>
    Spanish and French readers: if a sentence on a translated page reads badly, send it in.
    Those pages are checked by a person, and a reader who spots an error is doing the site a
    favour.
  </p>
  <p class="meta">Replies usually take a day or two. Page last checked 13 November 2026.</p>
</Base>
